id: phantom-genes
name: Phantom Genes
order: 3
optionOf: demon-genes
optionEffect: 5
description: >
  If you enter the Superior State through the 1st effect of Demon Genes, you may remove a Combat Condition (Impaired, Broken, Impediment, or Guard Down) you are suffering from.
text: >
  Phantom Genes [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you enter the Superior State through the 1st effect of Demon Genes, you may remove a Combat Condition (Impaired, Broken, Impediment, or Guard Down) you are suffering from.

---

# Into Superior through Demon Genes' roll (demon-genes-superior), once a Round: which of the four off, asked where there are several
# (chat.mjs demonGenesRoll). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button (the user's).
[triggered/demon-genes-superior, 1/round, effect 5]
requires hasCondition("impaired") || hasCondition("broken") || hasCondition("impediment") || hasCondition("guard-down");
phantomGenes.remove = true;
